Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libsmraw

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libsmraw/archive/refs/tags/20260902.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libsmraw-20260902-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libsmraw-20260902-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libsmraw-20260902-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libsmraw-20260902-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libsmraw1-20260902-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libsmraw-devel-20260902-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libsmraw-20260902-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libsmraw)
  /usr/bin/smrawmount.exe
  /usr/bin/smrawverify.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libsmraw.README
  /usr/share/doc/libsmraw/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libsmraw/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libsmraw/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libsmraw/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libsmraw/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/smrawmount.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/smrawverify.1.gz

(libsmraw1)
  /usr/bin/cygsmraw-1.dll

(libsmraw-devel)
  /usr/include/libsmraw.h
  /usr/include/libsmraw/codepage.h
  /usr/include/libsmraw/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libsmraw/error.h
  /usr/include/libsmraw/extern.h
  /usr/include/libsmraw/features.h
  /usr/include/libsmraw/types.h
  /usr/lib/libsmraw.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libsmraw.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libsmraw.3.gz

(python312-libsmraw)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pysmraw.cpython-312-x86_64-cygwin.dll

